        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background-color:#1b3a6b;background-image:linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 26%,transparent) 0.12cqw,transparent 0.12cqw),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 26%,transparent) 0.12cqw,transparent 0.12cqw),linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 12%,transparent) 0.08cqw,transparent 0.08cqw),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 12%,transparent) 0.08cqw,transparent 0.08cqw);background-size:10cqw 10cqw,10cqw 10cqw,2cqw 2cqw,2cqw 2cqw;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff'><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:3.4cqw;font:800 1.5cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c542'>Template</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:6.2cqw;font:800 10.5cqw/.9 Archivo Black,Impact,Haettenschweiler,Arial Black,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Task</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:17.85cqw;font:400 2.5cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#cfe0ff;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>A goal, the work that gets it done, and what is still undecided.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:23.200000000000003cqw;font:400 1.7cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#f5c542'>The status is worked out for you: change a work item and every view follows.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:27.6cqw;width:92cqw;height:30.166666666666657cqw;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:2cqw;background:color-mix(in srgb,#f5c542 7%,#1b3a6b);border:.3cqw solid color-mix(in srgb,#f5c542 28%,#1b3a6b)'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:9.644444444444444cqw;top:29.06666666666667cqw;width:15.200000000000003cqw;font:800 1.2cqw/1.25 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c542'>Imports</div><div style='position:absolute;left:9.644444444444444cqw;top:49.06666666666666cqw;width:15.200000000000003cqw;font:800 1.2cqw/1.25 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c542'>Exports</div><div style='position:absolute;left:22.400000000000002cqw;top:29.200000000000003cqw;height:26.966666666666658cqw;width:0;border-left:.2cqw dashed color-mix(in srgb,#f5c542 40%,#1b3a6b)'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:64.72cqw;top:29.200000000000003cqw;height:26.966666666666658cqw;width:0;border-left:.2cqw dashed color-mix(in srgb,#f5c542 40%,#1b3a6b)'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:24.000000000000004cqw;top:29cqw;font:800 1.2cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c542'>Example</div><div style='position:absolute;left:66.32cqw;top:29cqw;font:800 1.2cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c542'>How it works</div><ul style='position:absolute;left:66.32cqw;right:5.6cqw;top:31.6cqw;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;font:500 1.2cqw/1.35 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#cfe0ff'><li style='margin:0 0 .7cqw;padding-left:1.6cqw;position:relative'><i style='position:absolute;left:0;top:.5cqw;width:.7cqw;height:.7cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542'></i>Name the goal and say what done looks like. Mark it done to finish.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .7cqw;padding-left:1.6cqw;position:relative'><i style='position:absolute;left:0;top:.5cqw;width:.7cqw;height:.7cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542'></i>Add the work. Each item has a status; the goal contains them.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .7cqw;padding-left:1.6cqw;position:relative'><i style='position:absolute;left:0;top:.5cqw;width:.7cqw;height:.7cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542'></i>Put work in order with precedes, and block it with blocked-by.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .7cqw;padding-left:1.6cqw;position:relative'><i style='position:absolute;left:0;top:.5cqw;width:.7cqw;height:.7cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542'></i>When all the work is done the task is Ready to confirm.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .7cqw;padding-left:1.6cqw;position:relative'><i style='position:absolute;left:0;top:.5cqw;width:.7cqw;height:.7cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542'></i>Record a decision. Marking it decided closes the question and releases the work waiting on it.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .7cqw;padding-left:1.6cqw;position:relative'><i style='position:absolute;left:0;top:.5cqw;width:.7cqw;height:.7cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542'></i>Raise a question: it asks for you until it is answered, and holds back work that waits on it.</li></ul><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;bottom:2.4cqw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7cqw 2.4cqw;font:700 1.4cqw/1.25 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#f5c542'></div><div style='position:absolute;right:4cqw;top:3cqw;display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;font:700 1.9cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/what-a-canon-template-is/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>What a template is →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>Page Template →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/collection-template/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>Collection Template →</a></div></div></div>"
        },
